			text = [=[Auberdine is the harbor town of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, built on the coast facing {link:teldrassil}Teldrassil{/link}. Its elder, {link:thundris-windweaver}Thundris Windweaver{/link}, and its village council govern it. {link:sentinels}Sentinels{/link} guard it, and a moonwell at its heart gives the pure water its druids and priestesses need. Night elves and dwarves share its inn, its forges and its docks. From its piers a ship crosses to {link:rut-theran-village}Rut'theran Village{/link} below Teldrassil, and another sails to {link:menethil-harbor}Menethil Harbor{/link}. Now two new routes have come: one to {link:stormwind-harbor}Stormwind Harbor{/link}, and one to Menethil by way of {link:southshore}Southshore{/link} in the {link:hillsbrad-foothills}Hillsbrad Foothills{/link}. The town hopes the ships will bring aid. So far they have brought only travellers.]=],
