		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Tower of Althalaxx rises in the north-east of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}. It was the seat of {link:athrikus-narassin}Athrikus Narassin{/link}, the Highborne lord who governed {link:ameth-aran}Ameth'Aran{/link} and {link:bashal-aran}Bashal'Aran{/link} for {link:queen-azshara}Queen Azshara{/link} and spent most of his days away from them here. After ten thousand years, the tower has a master again. A company of warlocks calling itself the {link:cult-of-the-dark-strand}Cult of the Dark Strand{/link} has taken it, and the strongest of them keep to the upper rooms. A watcher of {link:auberdine}Auberdine{/link}, {link:balthule-shadowstrike}Balthule Shadowstrike{/link}, keeps his camp nearby. He has seen flashes of light from the top of the tower, and heard screams.]=],
