			text = [=[The Grove of the Ancients lies in the south of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, sheltered by the mountains. Here dwell the Ancients, great spirits of the forest who have stood beside the night elves since the oldest days. {link:onu}Onu{/link}, an Ancient of Lore, gathers word of every threat in the land, and the druids of {link:auberdine}Auberdine{/link} heed his warnings. Beside him stands {link:arbal}Arbal{/link}, an Ancient of War. The grove is patient, as all the Ancients are, but it is not idle. From here the fight against the {link:naga}naga{/link} and the {link:twilight-s-hammer}Twilight's Hammer{/link} is quietly planned.]=],
		},
	},
