	},
	hint = [=[Seek the Ancient of Lore in the grove near the southern mountains.]=],
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Onu is an Ancient of Lore, one of the great spirits of the forest, and he keeps the {link:grove-of-the-ancients}Grove of the Ancients{/link} in the south of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}. He speaks slowly and with long pauses, and he does not hurry. He knows that all things come to pass in their appointed time.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Onu is the memory of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}. He knows what the cultists of the {link:twilight-s-hammer}Twilight's Hammer{/link} worship, and he knows where one of their old lords fell. The druids and scholars of {link:auberdine}Auberdine{/link} send their gravest questions to him, and the Arch Druid {link:fandral-staghelm}Fandral Staghelm{/link} sends him messages from {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He sent watchers to the {link:the-master-s-glaive}Master's Glaive{/link} and learned that the {link:twilight-s-hammer}Twilight's Hammer{/link} was there.
• He studied a page torn from the cult's tome and sensed the magic of the old ones in it.
• He gathered relics from {link:ruins-of-mathystra}Mathystra{/link} to learn how the cult uses elven magic.
• He speaks of {link:malfurion-stormrage}Shan'do Stormrage{/link} as one who understood the patience of the forest.]=],
		},
	},
	chapters = {
		{
			key = "the-master-s-glaive",
			title = "The Master's Glaive",
			hint = "Go to the Master's Glaive at the Ancient's request.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 944 },
			},
			text = [=[Onu found it strange that the {link:naga}naga{/link} had come to {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}. He found it stranger still that the {link:twilight-s-hammer}Twilight's Hammer{/link} had come. When his fears were confirmed, he spoke of the old lord impaled at the Glaive. That lord is dead. His power, perhaps, is not.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "pages-of-the-old-ones",
			title = "Pages of the Old Ones",
			hint = "Bring the Ancient what was taken from the cult's camp.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 950 },
				{ type = "quest", id = 951 },
			},
			text = [=[The scribbles torn from the Twilight Tome held a chaotic magic, and beneath it lay the writing of elves. The cult was using ancient elven sorcery to bring its old masters back into the world. Onu set to learning how, before his enemies could finish what they had begun.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-stair-beneath-mathystra",
			title = "The Stair Beneath Mathystra",
			hint = [=[Bring the Ancient what remained of the guardian of Mathystra.]=],
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 98028 },
			},
			text = [=[When the globe of clouded water was laid before him, Onu showed something close to surprise. There was a stair beneath {link:ruins-of-mathystra}Mathystra{/link}, and a guardian had watched it. He would say only that he must speak with the other Ancients, and that it was well the stair had been found before the {link:naga}naga{/link} or the cult found it.]=],
