			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Alanndarian Nightsong called on the {link:cenarion-circle}Cenarion Circle{/link} of {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link} when the deer of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link} began to sicken. The poison is in the water, drawn from {link:cliffspring-falls}Cliffspring Falls{/link} into the whole land. She made a healing salve and cured what beasts she could. She warns that some in {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link} refuse to see the corruption spreading through the land.]=],
